1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,680
Did the young man speak English?
那个青年人会讲英语吗？

2
00:00:13,680 --> 00:00:16,630
Did the young man speak English?
那个青年人会讲英语吗？

3
00:00:19,190 --> 00:00:22,520
I had an amusing experience last year.
去年我有过一次有趣的经历。

4
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:26,390
After I had left a small village
在离开法国南部的一个小村庄后，

5
00:00:26,410 --> 00:00:28,350
in the south of France,
（那村庄在法国南部）

6
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,490
I drove on to the next town.
我继续驶往下一个城镇。

7
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:36,340
On the way, a young man waved to me.
途中，一个青年人向我招手。

8
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:40,090
I stopped and he asked me for a lift.
我把车停下，他向我要求搭车。

9
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,970
As soon as he had got into the car,
他一上车，

10
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:46,810
I said good morning to him in French
我就用法语向他问早上好，

11
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:49,930
and he replied in the same language.
他也同样用法语回答我。

12
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,670
Apart from a few words,
除了个别几个单词外，

13
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:56,390
I do not know any French at all.
我根本不会法语。

14
00:00:57,170 --> 00:00:59,900
Neither of us spoke during the journey.
旅途中我们谁也没讲话。

15
00:01:01,010 --> 00:01:03,320
I had nearly reached the town,
我快要到达那个镇时，

16
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:08,700
when the young man suddenly said, very slowly,
那青年人突然非常缓慢地开了口：

17
00:01:09,980 --> 00:01:13,150
'Do you speak English?'
“你会讲英语吗？”

18
00:01:15,260 --> 00:01:18,890
As I soon learnt, he was English himself!
我很快了解到，他自己就是个英国人！
